  "b": "Kanton (Guangzhou): Guangzhou’daki Liu Yin Liang’dan unvan aldı; Lingnan nominal Liang egemenliğinde",
  "tur": "toprak-kazanc",
  "onem": 2,
  "dunya": 1,
  "kapsam": "dis",
  "yer": "Kanton (Guangzhou) · Pekin (Hanbalık) · Kaifeng · Luoyang · Jingzhou · Çengdu (Chengdu) · Zhengding · Hangzhou · Changsha · Fuzhou · Leshou · Leshou (Xianxian) · Xi'an (Chang'an)",
