  "kaynak": "R. C. Majumdar (ed.), The History and Culture of the Indian People, Vol. III: The Classical Age, Bharatiya Vidya Bhavan, Bombay 1954 (archive.org: classicalage03bhar, tam metin okundu), «Northern India after the Gupta Empire»: \"They advanced against Kanauj, killed king Graha-varman, captured the city, and imprisoned queen Rajyasri.\"",
